# Lab: Giau tin trong am thanh bang phuong phap dieu chinh ti le thoi gian STSM.
# Muc tieu:
# 1. Tao file WAV PCM16 lam vat chua.
# 2. Ma hoa thong diep theo Hamming (7,4).
# 3. Nhung tung bit vao tung nhom 3 mau bang quy tac tong chan/le.
# 4. Tach tin va sua loi 1 bit tren moi tu ma Hamming.
# 5. Chung minh file stego co the khoi phuc thong diep va khoa sai/du lieu sai bi phat hien.

